    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know therapy is supposed to help but it feels like a waste of time when the reality is just... i am the problem. it's not just a mood, it's me. eventually they're going to realize that their lives would be so much lighter and better if i just stopped being a burden. it feels like the only way to actually help them is to stop being a factor in their lives entirely.",
